== Trivia ==
* The item is most likely based on [http://www.puttyworld.com/stat.html Crazy Aaron's Magnetic Thinking Putty], which has a color of the same name and the tears resemble it.
* [[wikipedia:Attractor#Strange attractor|Strange Attractor]] is also a mathematical concept found in dynamical linear systems.
* This item is used in {{chal|Waka Waka}}.

